Id: perm009f
Severity: FAIL
Category: filesystem
Check: check_perms
Fix: chmod 644 /etc/group, owned by root.
References: group(5)
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-6; ISO 8.3, 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The /etc/group file should not be writable by anyone other than root.
If a non-root user can modify the file, unauthorized privileges can
be obtained.
